 on lap six passed Campari into eighth position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":6,"text":"Chiron established a new lap record on lap six at 2m05s, equal to an average speed of 91.584 km/h","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":9,"text":"Nuvolari passes \"Williams\" and Lehoux.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":9,"text":"Nuvolari passes \"Williams\" and Lehoux.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":12,"text":"Despite Nuvolari's speed, he was unable to catch Chiron at this stage of the race but Nuvolari set a new fastest time with 2m04s on lap 12.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":12,"text":"Despite Nuvolari's speed, he was unable to catch Chiron at this stage of the race but Nuvolari set a new fastest time with 2m04s on lap 12.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":13,"text":"Ruggeri had to stop on lap 13 at his pits. After several tries he got his car going, but then had to retire his Maserati out on the circuit.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":16},{"lap":13,"text":"Ruggeri had to stop on lap 13 at his pits. After several tries he got his car going, but then had to retire his Maserati out on the circuit.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":16},{"lap":19,"text":"While trying to keep up with those ahead, Varzi established a new record on lap 19 of 2m02s, which was five seconds below the old record.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":19,"text":"While trying to keep up with those ahead, Varzi established a new record on lap 19 of 2m02s, which was five seconds below the old record.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":23,"text":"Gradually the leading trio pulled away from the rest of the field with Chiron in the lead, followed about 20 seconds later by Nuvolari and Varzi","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":23,"text":"Gradually the leading trio pulled away from the rest of the field with Chiron in the lead, followed about 20 seconds later by Nuvolari and Varzi","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":26,"text":"Chiron laps Divo and Zehender.","q":false,"c":15},{"lap":26,"text":"Chiron laps Divo and Zehender.","q":false,"c":15},{"lap":30,"text":"Nuvolari, now in attack mode, was closing and catching up with Chiron on lap 30.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"Chiron's Bugatti probably hit a sandbag, suddenly spun round, toppled over several times and came to rest slightly damaged at the sandbag barrier along the pier, which prevented the car from falling into the sea.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":30,"text":"Fortunately Chiron was just dazed by the fall and recovered quickly.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":30,"text":"Now Alfa Romeo was predominantly in the lead withVarzi's Bugatti a mere six seconds behind","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"Nuvolari, now in attack mode, was closing and catching up with Chiron on lap 30.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"Chiron's Bugatti probably hit a sandbag, suddenly spun round, toppled over several times and came to rest slightly damaged at the sandbag barrier along the pier, which prevented the car from falling into the sea.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":30,"text":"Fortunately Chiron was just dazed by the fall and recovered quickly.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":30,"text":"Now Alfa Romeo was predominantly in the lead withVarzi's Bugatti a mere six seconds behind","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":38,"text":"First Etancelin made a brief stop with fading brakes, followed by Lehoux with a long stop to fix his car, which was losing oil and overheated.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":13},{"lap":38,"text":"First Etancelin made a brief stop with fading brakes, followed by Lehoux with a long stop to fix his car, which was losing oil and overheated.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":13},{"lap":49,"text":"Etancelin and Czaykowski had to retire on lap 49 with gearbox problems, reducing the field to 13 cars.","q":tru