ciola by 30 seconds.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":68,"text":"Bouriat, the third man of the Bugatti team hit trouble when his car left the road at the Station hairpin.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":68,"text":"Bouriat, the third man of the Bugatti team hit trouble when his car left the road at the Station hairpin.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":71,"text":"On lap 71 Fagioli gained third position when he succeeded in getting past Borzacchini, whose brakes were fading fast.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":71,"text":"On lap 71 Fagioli gained third position when he succeeded in getting past Borzacchini, whose brakes were fading fast.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":80,"text":"By Caracciola still driving at his relatively moderate pace and Nuvolari also taking it easy, the Italian's advantage shrunk to just eight seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":80,"text":"By Caracciola still driving at his relatively moderate pace and Nuvolari also taking it easy, the Italian's advantage shrunk to just eight seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":85,"text":"After lap 85 Borzacchini stopped at his pit and retired with the brake problems, which had delayed his progress.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":85,"text":"After lap 85 Borzacchini stopped at his pit and retired with the brake problems, which had delayed his progress.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":95,"text":"A few laps from the end Nuvolari's car began to suffer from fuel pick-up problems and, as a result Caracciola was able to catch him.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":95,"text":"A few laps from the end Nuvolari's car began to suffer from fuel pick-up problems and, as a result Caracciola was able to catch him.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":100,"text":"Both passed the finish, a mere 2.8 seconds apart to enormous cheering.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":100,"text":"He won by just 2